Package: iris-vaapi
Version: 0.2.0-3
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Kumar-Jy <https://github.com/Kumar-Jy>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libva2, libdrm2
Description: Qualcomm SM8150 Iris VA-API hardware video decode driver & browser config
 Hardware VA-API video decode acceleration for Qualcomm SM8150 Iris VPU on
 Xiaomi Pad 5 (nabu), supporting H.264, VP9, and HEVC codecs.
 .
 Preconfigures hardware video decode acceleration for Google Chrome, Brave,
 and Mozilla Firefox out of the box.
